<title>UK: Navigator Gas sets two 10-year dollar bonds.</title>
<headline>Navigator Gas sets two 10-year dollar bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bonds was announced by lead  manager Credit Suisse First Boston.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NAVIGATOR GAS TRANSPORT PLC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  NAVIGATOR GAS</p>
<p> BOND 1</p>
<p> AMT    $217 MLN	COUPON     10.50     MATURITY    30.JUN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE  S-07.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  3.50	REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD     +448 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	CALL ON 30.JUN.02 AT 105.75, 2003 AT 103.50, 2004 AT</p>
<p>		101.75 AND 2005 AT PAR.</p>
<p>BOND 2</p>
<p> AMT     $87 MLN	COUPON     12.0	MATURITY    30.JUN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE  S-07.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  3.50	REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD     +598 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	CALL ON 30.JUN.02 AT 106.0, 2003 AT 104.0, 2004 AT</p>
<p>		102.0 AND 2005 AT PAR</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> PAY FREQ   SEMI-ANN  DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  LISTING    NONE	TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.50	SELL CONC  2.0	 PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.625 PCT 2007 U.S. TREASURY  NOTES	SECOND PRIORITY  SHIP MORTGAGE NOTES DUE 2007</p>
<p>		WITH WARRANTS.</p>
<p>	    S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
